WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:03.909
What happens to "Super Smash Bros." when it's
run through the Clockworks?

00:00:03.909 --> 00:00:09.580
Dr. Steph selected one copy of Nintendo's
"Super Smash Bros. Ultimate" for testing with

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:11.379
SCP-914.

00:00:11.379 --> 00:00:15.839
The item was placed into the intake booth,
and the machine was activated on the setting

00:00:15.839 --> 00:00:17.400
"Very Fine."

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:22.339
The output produced was what appeared to be
the input item, unchanged, but when a D-Class

00:00:22.339 --> 00:00:27.240
personnel was told to open the box, they were
blasted with an extremely bright stream of

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.899
light that caused temporary blindness, but
no other adverse effects.

